rystallize-based Skill bonus is situational."},{"name":"Serpent Spine","text":"Stacked DMG Bonus snapshots into Burst. Often her strongest choice at R5. Maintain stacks before Burst. R5 very strong."},{"name":"Akuoumaru","text":"Burst DMG increases with teammates’ combined Energy costs. Improves with refinements."},{"name":"Tidal Shadow","text":"Craftable ATK weapon; passive requires receiving healing."},{"name":"\"Ultimate Overlord's Mega Magic Sword\"","text":"Event-only ER and ATK; extra ATK depends on Melusine quests."}],"a":[{"names":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"text":"ER converts to Burst DMG, ideal for Stormbreaker.","stats":"ATK% or ER / Electro DMG / CRIT"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige","Thundering Fury"],"text":"Burst DMG plus Electro DMG; a flexible 2+2 alternative.","stats":"ATK% or ER / Electro DMG / CRIT"},{"names":["Thundersoother"],"text":"Damage bonus against Electro-affected enemies; aura-dependent.","stats":"ATK% or ER / Electro DMG / CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Thunderous Verdict","members":["Beidou","Clorinde","Nahida","Fischl"],"text":"Clorinde drives Beidou’s Burst with her Normal Attacks.","roles":["Off-field DPS","On-field DPS","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery"]},{"name":"Overload Armada","members":["Beidou","Arlecchino","Chevreuse","Fischl"],"text":"Arlecchino drives Pyro damage, Fischl and Beidou provide Electro, and Chevreuse buffs the Pyro/Electro team.","roles":["Off-field DPS","On-field DPS","Healer / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery"]},{"name":"Blooming Thunder","members":["Beidou","Nahida","Xingqiu","Kuki Shinobu"],"text":"Nahida drives Dendro and Xingqiu adds Hydro. Kuki triggers Hyperbloom, while Beidou deals Burst damage without targeting cores.","roles":["Off-field DPS","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Healer / Reaction Trigger"]},{"name":"Captain’s Taser","members":["Beidou","Sucrose","Xingqiu","Fischl"],"text":"Sucrose drives Beidou and Xingqiu with rapid attacks, groups enemies, and shreds re